<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish Sept producer output prices fall 0.7 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Irish Sept producer output prices fall 0.7 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish output prices for the manufacturing industries fell 0.2 percent in September and were down 0.7 percent from a year ago, Central Statistics Office data showed on Friday.  </p>
<p>		  Index (base 1985)   Monthly change   Yearly change</p>
<p>Latest month	   119.9		 -0.2		-0.7</p>
<p>Previous month	 120.2		 -0.4		+0.1</p>
<p>Year-ago month	 120.7		 +0.5		+3.6</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom 353 1 660 3377</p>
</text>
